      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹0.26 (vs ₹8.19 in FY 2025)",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹0.26 (down from ₹8.19 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹488.1m (up 67% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹6.40m (down 97% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 1.3% (down from 70% in FY 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 28% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 27% per year, which means it is well ahead of earnings.",
