      "date": "2026-05-29T09:59:00.000Z",
      "title": "Modi Rubber Limited Announces Appointment of Ajay Kumar Jain as Non-Executive Independent Director, Effective May 29, 2026",
      "body": "Modi Rubber Limited had approved the appointment of Mr. Ajay Kumar Jain as an Additional Director in the category of Non-Executive Independent Director of the Company with effect from May 29, 2026. Mr. Jain was appointed in terms of the applicable provisions of Companies Act, 2013, and Listing Regulations. Mr. Ajay Kumar Jain confirmed that he was not debarred from holding the office of Directors pursuant to any SEBI order or any other such authority. Mr. Ajay Kumar Jain holds an LLB (Hons) 1st Class from Meerut University (1983) and a B. Com. from Shriram College of Commerce, Delhi University (1980). He has been engaged in private practice and consultancy since September 1983, with practice areas including Constitutional Law, Contracts (Governments & Private), Taxation, Property & Commerc",
